sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Store Admin
    participant FE as React (subscription slice)
    participant SC as SubscriptionController
    participant SS as SubscriptionService
    participant PS as PaymentService
    participant GW as RazorpayService / StripeService
    participant EXT as Payment gateway
    participant PUB as PaymentEventPublisher
    participant LIS as PaymentEventListener
    participant ES as EmailService
    A->>FE: choose plan
    FE->>SC: POST /api/subscriptions/subscribe?storeId, planId, gateway
    SC->>SS: subscribe
    SS->>PS: initiate payment
    PS->>GW: create order / checkout session
    GW->>EXT: API call
    EXT-->>GW: checkout link
    PS->>PUB: publish PaymentInitiatedEvent
    SS-->>FE: checkoutUrl
    FE->>EXT: browser redirect to checkout
    A->>EXT: pays
    EXT-->>FE: redirect back / webhook
    FE->>PS: verify payment
    alt success
        PS->>PUB: publish PaymentSuccessEvent
        PUB->>LIS: event
        LIS->>SS: activate subscription
        LIS->>ES: send receipt email
    else failed
        PS->>PUB: publish PaymentFailedEvent
        PUB->>LIS: event
    end
